[center][size=5][b]Faster Spaceship Docking Rotation Reloaded[/b][/size]
Instant (or 10x) docking rotation, rebuilt for Cosmos[/center]

A rebuild of [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/FiatPax]FiatPax[/url]'s [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/2250]original mod[/url] for Cosmos, including both speeds in a FOMOD installer. Choose between [b]Instant[/b] or
[b]10x[/b] when installing.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies [i]GLOBALS/GCSPACESHIPGLOBALS.GLOBAL[/i]. It may conflict
with any other mod editing that file[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included[b] [/b]so you can merge with AMUMSS[b] [/b][/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url]. Hoping to clean that up and send a PR soonTM.

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/faster-spaceship-docking-rotation-reloaded]https://github.com/SavageCore/faster-spaceship-docking-rotation-reloaded[/url]
